-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Gutmann","x":"The cost savings of $50 million throughout the rest of 2020 are in addition to those from our $115 million restructuring programs announced earlier.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2020 Q2","e":"on","d":"2020-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Gutmann","x":"Second quarter GAAP operating expenses included approximately $11.8 million associated with our previously announced restructuring programs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2020 Q2","e":"on","d":"2020-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Gutmann","x":"The year-over-year decrease in non-GAAP operating expenses was driven primarily by strong execution on the cost front and by restructuring and cost-saving measures taken along the way by the company.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2020 Q3","e":"on","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Gutmann","x":"The year-over-year decrease in non-GAAP operating expenses was driven primarily by strong execution on the cost front, and by restructuring and cost saving measures undertaken by the company.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2020 Q3","e":"on","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Gutmann","x":"Our GAAP operating expenses include the amortization of intangibles, restructuring, asset impairments, and other charges, which are expected to be in the $32 million to $36 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q1","e":"on","d":"2021-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"When you have a pretty broad footprint, it could be as easy as streamlining technologies within a fab, you will get better utilization, you will get better cost while still running a very different set of products.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q1","e":"on","d":"2021-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"It will change the volumes at which you can run per fab by just streamlining on a technology basis or even in the back end on a package basis.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q2","e":"on","d":"2021-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"Some of the increases that we’ve seen we pass those on to customers, as I've described them in prior calls.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q2","e":"on","d":"2021-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Toshiya Hari","x":"Just curious, what percentage of discrepancies have you been able to execute on in the form of price increases?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q2","e":"on","d":"2021-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"Yes, if you look at the components of the gross margin strength, obviously, we -- we've always said in the first and second quarter now, we have probably thousands of line items that we are structurally working on improving our operation and streamlining our business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q2","e":"on","d":"2021-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"So we continue to streamline our operation take cost out of our products, and portfolio mix and portfolio rationalization, a couple quarters ago, I was asked that would be delayed because of the demand environment, my commentary has been, it's actually going to be accelerated because it's going…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q3","e":"on","d":"2021-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hassane El Khoury","x":"One is passing on the price increases to our customers, that's gross margin neutral to us, because we are passing on cost increases that we have incurred to our customers so that you can think of it as the margin neutral for us.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q3","e":"on","d":"2021-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hassane El Khoury","x":"For cost, I mentioned earlier, the price increases because the costs are neutral to the margin because we're passing it on to customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q3","e":"on","d":"2021-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hassane El Khoury","x":"That's what makes our solution attractive is because the efficiency drives a lot more cost reduction outside of the semiconductor than in the semiconductor.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q4","e":"on","d":"2022-02-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"We have been successful in passing those on to the customers, but we do expect that happening.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q4","e":"on","d":"2022-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"…expansion was driven by a strong and accelerated execution in closing price-to-value discrepancy, cost reduction initiatives, a focused drive on ramping new products, a deliberate intent to shift more capacity to products for our strategic markets and operational efficiencies across our…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2021 Q4","e":"on","d":"2022-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Harlan Sur","x":"Is most of this fixed cost reduction still ahead of the team?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2022 Q1","e":"on","d":"2022-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"Two, we do have net price increases that we've talked about, that $200 million that we've exited so far or the $32 million we exited with 22% margin this quarter, that is in a favorable pricing environment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2022 Q1","e":"on","d":"2022-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"But that was a net price increase because we're pricing ourselves out of that market.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2022 Q1","e":"on","d":"2022-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"We expect to see modest headwinds to our gross margin with increases in raw material and other input costs, as well as start-up costs as we aggressively ramp our silicon carbide manufacturing, offset by additional cost savings and manufacturing efficiencies.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2022 Q2","e":"on","d":"2022-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Harsh Kumar","x":"When I talk to investors that are negative or bearish on the stocks, they often bring up the fact that you guys might have been involved in raising prices a lot more aggressively than some of your other competitors.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2022 Q2","e":"on","d":"2022-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Harsh Kumar","x":"Is that even possible that you are super aggressive in raising prices and maintain business with our customers, or do you risk losing business?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2022 Q2","e":"on","d":"2022-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"We'll right-size our manufacturing and reallocate that capacity into automotive and industrial.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2022 Q3","e":"on","d":"2022-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"And Chris, the one thing I would add is as we see input costs going up, we are passing that on to our customers, and we'll continue to do that as well.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2022 Q3","e":"on","d":"2022-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Kwan","x":"Are there -- is there anything that you might want to highlight in terms of maybe the timing of these price increases that you're passing along versus the price increase that you're seeing in the supply chain?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2022 Q4","e":"on","d":"2023-02-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"So if we do get cost increases that are not part of already our LTSA or cost increases that are new that we haven't gotten yet from some of the vendors, we are -- of course, we'll pass those on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2023 Q2","e":"on","d":"2023-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"So obviously, part of that focus on what we call driver and controllers is the server or the cloud infrastructure, which applies definitely to AI, that's the play we have there.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2023 Q2","e":"on","d":"2023-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"It’s hard to take cost out when you running a fab at full capacity.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2023 Q2","e":"on","d":"2023-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"I think – you think about this has been probably a year maybe slightly more than a year of headwind for us as we continue to take the cost out.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2023 Q3","e":"on","d":"2023-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"As we move to our Fab Right strategy to optimize and drive efficiencies across our manufacturing network, we expect to generate incremental cost savings over the next few years.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2023 Q3","e":"on","d":"2023-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"Further, the yield improvement learnings we're getting from our 150-millimeter wafer production ramp is increasing our confidence in our 200-millimeter capability and validating our strategy of driving cost savings through brownfield investments.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q1","e":"on","d":"2024-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Toshiya Hari","x":"To level set us, can you speak to the exposure you have to AI or data center more broadly today?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q1","e":"on","d":"2024-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Toshiya Hari","x":"And how are you thinking about the growth profile there over the coming years given the focus on AI infrastructure spend across your end customers?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q2","e":"on","d":"2024-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"We are at the forefront of the fastest-growing segments of the automotive, industrial, and AI data center markets and we expect to resume our growth trajectory as end-customer inventory levels normalize.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q2","e":"on","d":"2024-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"I think with AI and data center ramping, you can think about that over a multi-year period.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q2","e":"on","d":"2024-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"In Q2, we executed additional restructuring actions to improve the cost structure of our manufacturing network to support our gross margin expansion plans.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q3","e":"on","d":"2024-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"We are in the markets that matter, the fastest growing segments of the automotive, industrial, and AI data center that will continue to outpace the growth of the semiconductor market overall and we are committed to delivering value to our customers through product and system-level innovation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q3","e":"on","d":"2024-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"We have invested in this space through the downturn, delivering a silicon and silicon carbide portfolio capable of meeting the ever-increasing demands of AI data centers across the entire power tree.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q3","e":"on","d":"2024-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"We are focused on Fab Right, we're continuing to take cost out.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q3","e":"on","d":"2024-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"I've said this many times, we continue to optimize that footprint and drive cost out and drive efficiency up, which gets more units out.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q4","e":"on","d":"2025-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"We believe electrification, AI data center, and renewable energy are still the major growth drivers for our industry over the next decade.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q4","e":"on","d":"2025-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"We've invested in differentiated products to win with disruptive innovation and the high-growth megatrends of automotive, industrial, and AI data centers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q4","e":"on","d":"2025-02-10","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"Entering Q1, we expect persisting volatility due to the geopolitical uncertainty across all geographies as our customers assess their manufacturing footprints and the impact of tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q4","e":"on","d":"2025-02-10","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"Given, really, the volatility and backdrop of geopolitical and tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q4","e":"on","d":"2025-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"Looking to 2025 and beyond, we believe rightsizing the organization will benefit the company in the long term.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2024 Q4","e":"on","d":"2025-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"We are exploring a number of options, including rationalization of our product headcount reductions and potential site closures.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q1","e":"on","d":"2025-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"Medical and aerospace and defense also increased sequentially, and our AI data center revenue, which we report as part of our other bucket, more than doubled year-over-year in the first quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q1","e":"on","d":"2025-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"In AI data center, we continue to make progress in our strategy by leveraging our strengths in intelligent power.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q1","e":"on","d":"2025-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"First, our guidance is inclusive of our current expectation that there is no material direct impact of tariffs announced as of today.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q1","e":"on","d":"2025-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"Now, there is uncertainty given the tariff situation, but there’s some early signs of stabilization which gives us some hope.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q1","e":"on","d":"2025-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"The second action in Q1 was a company-wide restructuring initiative.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q1","e":"on","d":"2025-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"Turning to gross margin in the first quarter, GAAP gross margin was 20.3%, which includes restructuring charges as a part of our manufacturing realignment program.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q3","e":"on","d":"2025-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"Our new products continue to scale, and our design funnel now exceeds $1 billion, driven by strong customer engagement across automotive, industrial, and AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/on-semiconductor-on-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q3","e":"on","d":"2025-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"It reduces energy loss by up to 50%, making it ideal for AI data centers, EVs, renewable energy, and aerospace defense and security.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/on-semiconductor-on-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q3","e":"on","d":"2025-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"Our guidance is inclusive of our current expectation that there is no material direct impact of tariffs announced as of today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/on-semiconductor-on-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q3","e":"on","d":"2025-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"As you go from a tariff to a market pricing, there's a shift in there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/on-semiconductor-on-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q3","e":"on","d":"2025-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Gary Mobley","x":"And I guess there's been some news, maybe it's a few months old now about, you know, the big analog player raising prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/on-semiconductor-on-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q4","e":"on","d":"2026-02-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"We delivered more than $250 million in AI data center revenue across the PowerTree.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/09/on-semiconductor-on-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q4","e":"on","d":"2026-02-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"As a reminder, VGaN is built on proprietary GaN on GaN technology, is manufactured in our fab in the US, and positions us for a multiyear competitive advantage in high voltage and high power density applications spanning AI data centers, EVs, renewables, and aerospace defense and security.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/09/on-semiconductor-on-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q4","e":"on","d":"2026-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"GAAP operating expenses were $351 million, including $59 million in restructuring expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/09/on-semiconductor-on-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2025 Q4","e":"on","d":"2026-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"The fact that we're actually expanding gross margins 30 basis points shows you that our FabRite initiatives of taking cost out are offsetting the headwind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/09/on-semiconductor-on-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2026 Q1","e":"on","d":"2026-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"Our AI data center business is accelerating, with Q1 revenue growing more than 30% quarter over quarter and doubling year over year, reflecting platform ramps and expanding engagement across the PowerTree.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/on-on-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2026 Q1","e":"on","d":"2026-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"We expect our 2026 AI data center revenue to double compared to full year 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/on-on-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2026 Q1","e":"on","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Trent","x":"GAAP operating expenses were $637 million, including $329 million in restructuring expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/on-on-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ON 2026 Q2","e":"on","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hassane El-Khoury","x":"As we anticipated, the recovery continued to take shape during the quarter with continued strength in our AI data center business.",